{"id":2762,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的二十届四中全会精神，全面落实习近平总书记关于青年工作的重要思想，进一步强化团员思想政治引领，我院于12月30日下午在15602H教室开展2025年度专题组织生活会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLmGLZUllDMm7bnMRUiolnRL7-PUzWo7oRM7nR7PLzCaMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hkUShkoRLZLRU8L7W7LmnVLNWRMRCDU8-DLRfRMzrFn7rRo778L7VFoRlsn1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPM4lJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6175&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5D6BAB8380440BD24E2BC466CB600C55/DEC8A40A/857F\" vheight=\"210.07000732421875\" vwidth=\"244.92999267578125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLmGLZUllDMm7bnMRUiolnRL7-PUzWo7oRM7nR7PLzCaMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hkUShkoRLZLRU8L7W7LmnVLNWRMRCDU8-DLRfRMzrFn7rRo778L7VFoRlsn1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPM4lJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6175&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>会议在庄严的团歌《光荣啊，中国共青团》中拉开序幕。学院各团支部书记首先就本年度学习与工作开展情况作总结汇报，并围绕工作中存在的不足提出改进思路，为下一阶段工作明确方向；随后，各团组织班委及团员代表结合自身实际，梳理年度学习与工作心得，严肃查摆不足、剖析原因；各支部严格对照团员先进性评价标准，扎实开展民主评议；最后，全体团员整齐肃立，共同重温入团誓词。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozULDoRUPLRCDUM4-YLzNPnzvYM7QofUzLDUN7ZL4f7Lzv0gihFp2hmCIa0USh2M1ybLkyPoRM2ozMVnl78UzAVolLiMRWVLzT2nm-sLmAFU4CaUlUbMzfFolL8nkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPM4lJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6175&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AF690183F93EEA4A8E9C542E19FF2728/C60AD950/9C4D\" vheight=\"209.8699951171875\" vwidth=\"255.8699951171875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozULDoRUPLRCDUM4-YLzNPnzvYM7QofUzLDUN7ZL4f7Lzv0gihFp2hmCIa0USh2M1ybLkyPoRM2ozMVnl78UzAVolLiMRWVLzT2nm-sLmAFU4CaUlUbMzfFolL8nkb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPM4lJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6175&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次会议有效提升了基层团组织的凝聚力和战斗力，学院团组织将持续加强团员队伍建设，引导全体团员将会议成果转化为实际行动，以更饱满的热情投身学习与工作，书写新时代青春华章。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLmGLZUllDMm7bnMRUiolnRL7-PUzWo7oRM7nR7PLzCaMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7M1hkUShkoRLZLRU8L7W7LmnVLNWRMRCDU8-DLRfRMzrFn7rRo778L7VFoRlsn1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPM4lJqdunx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6175&e=.jpeg"}